{"channelId":"UCo7i9nlepxa5WV7E6d1X2qw","row":["Animal Rescue stories",77,"welcome to out channel,Animal Rescue Stories is your front-row seat to real-life rescues, remarkable recoveries, and the courage of animals and their human allies. Each week we bring you heartwarming rescues, behind-the-scenes veterinary care, and hopeful journeys of animals finding safe, loving homes. Our storytelling blends urgency with compassion to inform, inspire, and empower viewers to help—whether by volunteering, adopting, donating, or spreading awareness.\n\nWhat to expect: true rescue stories from start to finish; behind-the-scenes rescue operations, medical care, and rehabilitation; practical tips on animal care and welfare; profiles of rescuers, foster families, and adopters; clear calls to action to volunteer, foster, adopt, donate, or advocate.\n\nThis channel is for animal lovers, families, aspiring rescuers, and anyone who believes in second chances. Subscribe and join our community—one rescue at a time.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCo7i9nlepxa5WV7E6d1X2qw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCo7i9nlepxa5WV7E6d1X2qw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:46.133Z","channelId":"UCo7i9nlepxa5WV7E6d1X2qw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"10bdfcca03dd1ec77b1465f471aa3ae2d60f0c68b2cc467b2065fd270100ee1e","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"328bd0503240ef51319b0ac3ee4afef0e4317340c0d3c28aecd84cad5093a4dc"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCo7i9nlepxa5WV7E6d1X2qw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:46.133Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCo7i9nlepxa5WV7E6d1X2qw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":77,"raw":"77 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCo7i9nlepxa5WV7E6d1X2qw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:46.133Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeyword